Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["Rigid rotation of a spin-helix state in the open XXZ chain", "Title",ExpressionUUID->"bb30cb93-2a5f-254e-9046-dcb2f7012404"],

Cell["\<\
Purpose: decide, by exact construction and by direct real-time simulation, \
whether an initial spin-helix product state of the open, finite XXZ chain can \
rotate rigidly about the z axis, i.e. whether psi(t) = (global phase) x \
helix(q, theta, phi0 + w t) for all t.
Organization: Section 1 fixes the model and conventions, Section 2 defines \
the helix states and their free parameters, Section 3 derives and tests the \
parameter choice that supports a rigid rotation, Section 4 integrates the \
Schroedinger equation in the laboratory frame and produces the plots. Each \
section contains its own definitions and its own VerificationTest block. \
Sections are meant to be evaluated in order: Section k uses the definitions \
of Sections 1, ..., k-1 only.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"936d9953-2522-f34a-9a55-af47470a0015"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["1. Conventions for the open XXZ model", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"68715e90-835c-8740-a779-bc8f762a0e76"],

Cell["\<\
Hilbert space: n spins 1/2, site 1 is the leftmost tensor factor, local basis \
{|up>, |down>} = {|0>, |1>}, S^a_j = sigma^a_j / 2, hbar = 1.
Hamiltonian (spin convention):
H = J Sum_{j=1}^{n-1} (S^x_j S^x_{j+1} + S^y_j S^y_{j+1} + Delta S^z_j \
S^z_{j+1}) + hL . S_1 + hR . S_n + hz S^z_tot.
hL and hR are arbitrary 3-vectors acting on the two edge spins only; hz is a \
uniform longitudinal field. The bulk part commutes with S^z_tot; arbitrary \
edge fields do not.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7ac0b997-679c-1c4b-91d1-f39f6869d7f7"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"SpinOperator", "[", 
     RowBox[{"a_Integer", ",", " ", "j_Integer", ",", " ", "n_Integer"}], 
     "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
    RowBox[{"KroneckerProduct", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"IdentityMatrix", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"2", "^", 
         RowBox[{"(", 
          RowBox[{"j", " ", "-", " ", "1"}], ")"}]}], ",", " ", 
        "SparseArray"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"SparseArray", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"PauliMatrix", "[", "a", "]"}], "/", "2"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"IdentityMatrix", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"2", "^", 
         RowBox[{"(", 
          RowBox[{"n", " ", "-", " ", "j"}], ")"}]}], ",", " ", 
        "SparseArray"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"XXZBulkHamiltonian", "[", 
     RowBox[{"J_", ",", " ", "delta_", ",", " ", "n_Integer"}], "]"}], " ", ":=",
     " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"SparseArray", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", "}"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"2", "^", "n"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"2", "^", "n"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}], " ", "+", " ", 
     RowBox[{"J", " ", 
      RowBox[{"Sum", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"SpinOperator", "[", 
           RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", "j", ",", " ", "n"}], "]"}], " ", ".", " ", 
          RowBox[{"SpinOperator", "[", 
           RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"j", " ", "+", " ", "1"}], ",", " ", "n"}], "]"}]}], " ", 
         "+", " ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"SpinOperator", "[", 
           RowBox[{"2", ",", " ", "j", ",", " ", "n"}], "]"}], " ", ".", " ", 
          RowBox[{"SpinOperator", "[", 
           RowBox[{"2", ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"j", " ", "+", " ", "1"}], ",", " ", "n"}], "]"}]}], " ", 
         "+", " ", 
         RowBox[{"delta", " ", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"SpinOperator", "[", 
            RowBox[{"3", ",", " ", "j", ",", " ", "n"}], "]"}], " ", ".", " ", 
           RowBox[{"SpinOperator", "[", 
            RowBox[{"3", ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"j", " ", "+", " ", "1"}], ",", " ", "n"}], "]"}]}]}]}], 
        ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"j", ",", " ", "1", ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"n", " ", "-", " ", "1"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}]}]}], ";"}], 
  "\n"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"EdgeFieldOperator", "[", 
     RowBox[{"h_List", ",", " ", "j_Integer", ",", " ", "n_Integer"}], "]"}], 
    " ", ":=", " ", 
    RowBox[{"Sum", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"h", "[", 
        RowBox[{"[", "a", "]"}], "]"}], " ", 
       RowBox[{"SpinOperator", "[", 
        RowBox[{"a", ",", " ", "j", ",", " ", "n"}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"a", ",", " ", "3"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"TotalSzOperator", "[", "n_Integer", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
    RowBox[{"SparseArray", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Band", "[", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", "1"}], "}"}], "]"}], " ", "->", " ", 
       RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"n", "/", "2"}], " ", "-", " ", 
          RowBox[{"DigitCount", "[", 
           RowBox[{"b", ",", " ", "2", ",", " ", "1"}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"b", ",", " ", "0", ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"2", "^", "n"}], " ", "-", " ", "1"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}],
       ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"2", "^", "n"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"2", "^", "n"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"OpenXXZHamiltonian", "[", 
    RowBox[{
    "J_", ",", " ", "delta_", ",", " ", "n_Integer", ",", " ", "hL_List", ",",
      " ", "hR_List", ",", " ", "hz_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"XXZBulkHamiltonian", "[", 
     RowBox[{"J", ",", " ", "delta", ",", " ", "n"}], "]"}], " ", "+", " ", 
    RowBox[{"EdgeFieldOperator", "[", 
     RowBox[{"hL", ",", " ", "1", ",", " ", "n"}], "]"}], " ", "+", " ", 
    RowBox[{"EdgeFieldOperator", "[", 
     RowBox[{"hR", ",", " ", "n", ",", " ", "n"}], "]"}], " ", "+", " ", 
    RowBox[{"hz", " ", 
     RowBox[{"TotalSzOperator", "[", "n", "]"}]}]}]}], ";"}]}], "Code",
 CellLabel->"In[1]:=",ExpressionUUID->"5f7eb546-93ba-6f44-bc60-8a93e83d6c4d"],

Cell["\<\
Rotations about z. U(alpha) = exp(-i alpha S^z_tot) is diagonal in the \
computational basis. Because the bulk is U(1) invariant and S^a transforms as \
a vector, U(alpha) H(hL, hR) U(alpha)^dagger = H(R_z(alpha) hL, R_z(alpha) \
hR): a rotation of the state is equivalent to a rotation of the two edge \
fields. This identity is the backbone of Section 3.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"82ea868c-0f5b-f540-b5f0-256a657011ad"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"ZRotationOperator", "[", 
     RowBox[{"alpha_", ",", " ", "n_Integer"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
    RowBox[{"SparseArray", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Band", "[", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", "1"}], "}"}], "]"}], " ", "->", " ", 
       RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Exp", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"-", "I"}], " ", "alpha", " ", 
           RowBox[{"(", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"n", "/", "2"}], " ", "-", " ", 
             RowBox[{"DigitCount", "[", 
              RowBox[{"b", ",", " ", "2", ",", " ", "1"}], "]"}]}], ")"}]}], 
          "]"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"b", ",", " ", "0", ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"2", "^", "n"}], " ", "-", " ", "1"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}],
       ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"2", "^", "n"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"2", "^", "n"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"RotateAboutZ", "[", 
     RowBox[{"v_List", ",", " ", "alpha_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"RotationMatrix", "[", 
      RowBox[{"alpha", ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", "0", ",", " ", "1"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], " ", ".",
      " ", "v"}]}], ";"}], "\n"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"LocalSpinOperators", "[", "n_Integer", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"LocalSpinOperators", "[", "n", "]"}], " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"N", "[", 
        RowBox[{"SpinOperator", "[", 
         RowBox[{"a", ",", " ", "j", ",", " ", "n"}], "]"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"j", ",", " ", "n"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"a", ",", " ", "3"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}]}], ";"}], "\n"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"LocalSpinExpectations", "[", 
    RowBox[{"psi_List", ",", " ", "n_Integer"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Map", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"Re", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Conjugate", "[", "psi", "]"}], " ", ".", " ", 
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{"#", " ", ".", " ", "psi"}], ")"}]}], "]"}], " ", "&"}], ",",
      " ", 
     RowBox[{"LocalSpinOperators", "[", "n", "]"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", "2", "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}]}], "Code",
 CellLabel->"In[6]:=",ExpressionUUID->"eb09c76d-28bf-6543-aef8-cc243ddefd5c"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Tests of the conventions", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"030bc3c1-5e65-074e-99fe-c3e4b5f82556"],

Cell["\<\
Checked: Hermiticity, normalization of one bond in the user's matrix form \
(J/4){{Delta,0,0,0},{0,-Delta,2,0},{0,2,-Delta,0},{0,0,0,Delta}}, energy of \
the fully polarized state, U(1) invariance of the bulk, the \
rotation-covariance identity above, and the closed form of U(alpha).\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"5b202351-066f-3d47-9e36-fd6aab305eaa"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"n", " ", "=", " ", "4"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"J", " ", "=", " ", "1.3"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"delta", " ", "=", " ", "0.37"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"hL", " ", "=", " ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"0.3", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"-", "0.7"}], ",", " ", "0.2"}], "}"}]}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"hR", " ", "=", " ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"-", "0.4"}], ",", " ", "0.1", ",", " ", "0.9"}], "}"}]}], ",",
      " ", 
     RowBox[{"hz", " ", "=", " ", "0.25"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"alpha", " ", "=", " ", "0.81"}], ",", " ", "h"}], "}"}], ",", 
   "\n", "  ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"h", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"OpenXXZHamiltonian", "[", 
      RowBox[{
      "J", ",", " ", "delta", ",", " ", "n", ",", " ", "hL", ",", " ", "hR", ",",
        " ", "hz"}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", "  ", 
    RowBox[{"TestReport", "[", 
     RowBox[{"{", "\n", "    ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"VerificationTest", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
          RowBox[{"Abs", "[", 
           RowBox[{"h", " ", "-", " ", 
            RowBox[{"ConjugateTranspose", "[", "h", "]"}]}], "]"}], "]"}], ",",
          " ", "0.", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"SameTest", " ", "->", " ", 
          RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"Abs", "[", 
              RowBox[{"#1", " ", "-", " ", "#2"}], "]"}], " ", "<", " ", 
             RowBox[{"10", "^", 
              RowBox[{"-", "12"}]}]}], " ", "&"}], ")"}]}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"TestID", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<Hermiticity\>\""}]}], "]"}], ",",
        "\n", "    ", 
       RowBox[{"VerificationTest", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Normal", "[", 
          RowBox[{"XXZBulkHamiltonian", "[", 
           RowBox[{"J", ",", " ", "delta", ",", " ", "2"}], "]"}], "]"}], ",",
          " ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"J", "/", "4"}], " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{"delta", ",", " ", "0", ",", " ", "0", ",", " ", "0"}], 
             "}"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", 
              RowBox[{"-", "delta"}], ",", " ", "2", ",", " ", "0"}], "}"}], ",",
             " ", 
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", "2", ",", " ", 
              RowBox[{"-", "delta"}], ",", " ", "0"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", "0", ",", " ", "0", ",", " ", "delta"}], 
             "}"}]}], "}"}]}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"SameTest", " ", "->", " ", 
          RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
              RowBox[{"Abs", "[", 
               RowBox[{"#1", " ", "-", " ", "#2"}], "]"}], "]"}], " ", "<", 
             " ", 
             RowBox[{"10", "^", 
              RowBox[{"-", "12"}]}]}], " ", "&"}], ")"}]}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"TestID", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<Bond normalization\>\""}]}], 
        "]"}], ",", "\n", "    ", 
       RowBox[{"VerificationTest", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Normal", "[", 
           RowBox[{"XXZBulkHamiltonian", "[", 
            RowBox[{"J", ",", " ", "delta", ",", " ", "n"}], "]"}], "]"}], "[", 
          RowBox[{"[", 
           RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", "1"}], "]"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"J", " ", "delta", " ", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"(", 
            RowBox[{"n", " ", "-", " ", "1"}], ")"}], "/", "4"}]}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"SameTest", " ", "->", " ", 
          RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"Abs", "[", 
              RowBox[{"#1", " ", "-", " ", "#2"}], "]"}], " ", "<", " ", 
             RowBox[{"10", "^", 
              RowBox[{"-", "12"}]}]}], " ", "&"}], ")"}]}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"TestID", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<Polarized energy\>\""}]}], 
        "]"}], ",", "\n", "    ", 
       RowBox[{"VerificationTest", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
          RowBox[{"Abs", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"XXZBulkHamiltonian", "[", 
              RowBox[{"J", ",", " ", "delta", ",", " ", "n"}], "]"}], " ", ".",
              " ", 
             RowBox[{"TotalSzOperator", "[", "n", "]"}]}], " ", "-", " ", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"TotalSzOperator", "[", "n", "]"}], " ", ".", " ", 
             RowBox[{"XXZBulkHamiltonian", "[", 
              RowBox[{"J", ",", " ", "delta", ",", " ", "n"}], "]"}]}]}], 
           "]"}], "]"}], ",", " ", "0.", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"SameTest", " ", "->", " ", 
          RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"Abs", "[", 
              RowBox[{"#1", " ", "-", " ", "#2"}], "]"}], " ", "<", " ", 
             RowBox[{"10", "^", 
              RowBox[{"-", "12"}]}]}], " ", "&"}], ")"}]}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"TestID", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<Bulk U(1) symmetry\>\""}]}], 
        "]"}], ",", "\n", "    ", 
       RowBox[{"VerificationTest", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
          RowBox[{"Abs", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"N", "[", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"ZRotationOperator", "[", 
               RowBox[{"alpha", ",", " ", "n"}], "]"}], " ", ".", " ", "h", 
              " ", ".", " ", 
              RowBox[{"ConjugateTranspose", "[", 
               RowBox[{"ZRotationOperator", "[", 
                RowBox[{"alpha", ",", " ", "n"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], "]"}], " ", 
            "-", " ", 
            RowBox[{"OpenXXZHamiltonian", "[", 
             RowBox[{"J", ",", " ", "delta", ",", " ", "n", ",", " ", 
              RowBox[{"RotateAboutZ", "[", 
               RowBox[{"hL", ",", " ", "alpha"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
              RowBox[{"RotateAboutZ", "[", 
               RowBox[{"hR", ",", " ", "alpha"}], "]"}], ",", " ", "hz"}], 
             "]"}]}], "]"}], "]"}], ",", " ", "0.", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"SameTest", " ", "->", " ", 
          RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"Abs", "[", 
              RowBox[{"#1", " ", "-", " ", "#2"}], "]"}], " ", "<", " ", 
             RowBox[{"10", "^", 
              RowBox[{"-", "12"}]}]}], " ", "&"}], ")"}]}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"TestID", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<Rotation covariance\>\""}]}], 
        "]"}], ",", "\n", "    ", 
       RowBox[{"VerificationTest", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
          RowBox[{"Abs", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"Normal", "[", 
             RowBox[{"N", "[", 
              RowBox[{"ZRotationOperator", "[", 
               RowBox[{"alpha", ",", " ", "n"}], "]"}], "]"}], "]"}], " ", "-",
             " ", 
            RowBox[{"MatrixExp", "[", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"-", "I"}], " ", "alpha", " ", 
              RowBox[{"Normal", "[", 
               RowBox[{"N", "[", 
                RowBox[{"TotalSzOperator", "[", "n", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], 
             "]"}]}], "]"}], "]"}], ",", " ", "0.", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"SameTest", " ", "->", " ", 
          RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"Abs", "[", 
              RowBox[{"#1", " ", "-", " ", "#2"}], "]"}], " ", "<", " ", 
             RowBox[{"10", "^", 
              RowBox[{"-", "12"}]}]}], " ", "&"}], ")"}]}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{
         "TestID", " ", "->", " ", "\"\<Closed form of U(alpha)\>\""}]}], 
        "]"}]}], "\n", "  ", "}"}], "]"}]}]}], "\n", "]"}]], "Code",
 CellLabel->"In[10]:=",ExpressionUUID->"f23d8b54-37c8-014a-a632-d92bc7bbd7d1"],

