Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["3. Parameters that support a rigid helix", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"48a00907-3352-1f4b-b78a-7a649910b8c9"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["3.1 Static step: the helix as an exact eigenstate", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"22dd8a3e-2e74-1948-be50-8a9844397a9f"],

Cell["\<\
For a product state with constant theta and constant winding q, the bulk \
residual of every bond cancels in the telescoping sum iff Delta = cos q, \
leaving two uncompensated terms localized on sites 1 and n. They are removed \
by the matched edge fields
hL = -(J sin q sin theta / 2) t(phi) + bL n(theta, phi),
hR = +(J sin q sin theta / 2) t(phi_n) + bR n(theta, phi_n),   phi_n = phi + \
(n-1) q,
with t(alpha) = (-sin alpha, cos alpha, 0) the azimuthal tangent and n(theta, \
alpha) the local Bloch direction. bL and bR are free: a field parallel to the \
local spin only shifts the energy. Then H(hL, hR, hz = 0) |psi> = E_h |psi>, \
E_h = J (n-1) cos q / 4 + (bL + bR)/2.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"ddb13ddc-437d-d542-85bf-23c64f1ffc78"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"AzimuthalTangent", "[", "alpha_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"-", 
       RowBox[{"Sin", "[", "alpha", "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"Cos", "[", "alpha", "]"}], ",", " ", "0"}], "}"}]}], ";"}], 
  "\n"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"MatchedEdgeFields", "[", 
     RowBox[{
     "J_", ",", " ", "q_", ",", " ", "theta_", ",", " ", "phi_", ",", " ", 
      "n_Integer", ",", " ", "bL_", ",", " ", "bR_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"-", "J"}], " ", 
        RowBox[{"Sin", "[", "q", "]"}], " ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Sin", "[", "theta", "]"}], "/", "2"}], " ", 
        RowBox[{"AzimuthalTangent", "[", "phi", "]"}]}], " ", "+", " ", 
       RowBox[{"bL", " ", 
        RowBox[{"BlochUnitVector", "[", 
         RowBox[{"theta", ",", " ", "phi"}], "]"}]}]}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"J", " ", 
        RowBox[{"Sin", "[", "q", "]"}], " ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Sin", "[", "theta", "]"}], "/", "2"}], " ", 
        RowBox[{"AzimuthalTangent", "[", 
         RowBox[{"phi", " ", "+", " ", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"(", 
            RowBox[{"n", " ", "-", " ", "1"}], ")"}], " ", "q"}]}], "]"}]}], 
       " ", "+", " ", 
       RowBox[{"bR", " ", 
        RowBox[{"BlochUnitVector", "[", 
         RowBox[{"theta", ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"phi", " ", "+", " ", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"(", 
             RowBox[{"n", " ", "-", " ", "1"}], ")"}], " ", "q"}]}]}], 
         "]"}]}]}]}], "}"}]}], ";"}], "\n"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"StaticHelixEnergy", "[", 
    RowBox[{
    "J_", ",", " ", "q_", ",", " ", "n_Integer", ",", " ", "bL_", ",", " ", 
     "bR_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"J", " ", 
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{"n", " ", "-", " ", "1"}], ")"}], " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"Cos", "[", "q", "]"}], "/", "4"}]}], " ", "+", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{"bL", " ", "+", " ", "bR"}], ")"}], "/", "2"}]}]}], 
  ";"}]}], "Code",
 CellLabel->"In[20]:=",ExpressionUUID->"61fd4ef7-d4af-0149-85f0-31094034d96b"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["3.2 Dynamic step: co-rotating fields and the rotating frame", \
"Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"5b8d29be-ec21-a045-8a66-d471d12ccb1f"],

Cell["\<\
A static field cannot make the helix rotate: an eigenstate only acquires a \
phase. Rotation requires the edge fields themselves to turn. Take the matched \
fields at the moving azimuth phi0 + w t (w = FieldOmega). Because both \
t(alpha) and n(theta, alpha) are covariant, MatchedEdgeFields[.., phi0 + w t, \
..] = R_z(w t) MatchedEdgeFields[.., phi0, ..], and by Section 1
H(t) = U(w t) H(0) U(w t)^dagger,   U(a) = exp(-i a S^z_tot).
Writing psi(t) = U(w t) chi(t) gives i d chi/dt = G chi with the \
time-independent rotating-frame generator
G = H(0) - w S^z_tot = H_XXZ + hL(phi0) . S_1 + hR(phi0) . S_n + (hz - w) \
S^z_tot.
Exact solution: psi(t) = U(w t) exp(-i G t) psi(0).
Rigidity criterion. psi(t) = (phase) U(w t) psi(0), i.e. the helix turns \
rigidly together with the fields, iff chi(t) = (phase) psi(0), i.e. iff \
psi(0) is an eigenvector of G. With Delta = cos q and matched fields, psi(0) \
is an eigenvector of H_XXZ + hL(phi0) . S_1 + hR(phi0) . S_n but not of \
S^z_tot (for 0 < theta < Pi), so the remaining condition is
hz = w.
Then psi(t) = exp(-i E_h t) exp(-i n w t/2) |psi(q, theta, phi0 + w t)>: \
exactly rigid, at angular velocity w = hz, with all spins keeping |<S_j>| = \
1/2.
Scope of the statement: it covers rotation locked to the fields. A rigid \
rotation at some other rate is not excluded by this argument; the \
BestFidelity diagnostic of Section 4 (maximum over all rotation angles) tests \
for it numerically.
The four protocols below isolate each ingredient:
A: co-rotating matched fields with hz = w (all conditions met).
B: static matched fields plus hz (the bulk would precess, the edges are \
pinned).
C: co-rotating matched fields with hz = 0 (the edges are dragged, the bulk is \
not).
D: free ends plus hz (uniform Larmor precession on top of the non-stationary \
free-end dynamics).\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"66ca260a-ba69-0645-9843-17d6cda3ed4b"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"HelixProtocol", "[", 
     RowBox[{
     "n_Integer", ",", " ", "J_", ",", " ", "q_", ",", " ", "theta_", ",", 
      " ", "phi0_", ",", " ", "bL_", ",", " ", "bR_", ",", " ", "delta_", ",",
       " ", "hz_", ",", " ", "omega_", ",", " ", "edgeFields_"}], "]"}], " ", 
    ":=", " ", 
    RowBox[{"<|", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"\"\<L\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "n"}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"\"\<J\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "J"}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"\"\<q\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "q"}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"\"\<theta\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "theta"}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"\"\<phi0\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "phi0"}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"\"\<bL\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "bL"}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"\"\<bR\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "bR"}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"\"\<Delta\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "delta"}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"\"\<hz\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "hz"}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"\"\<FieldOmega\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "omega"}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"\"\<EdgeFields\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "edgeFields"}]}], 
     "|>"}]}], ";"}], "\n"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"RigidRotationProtocol", "[", 
     RowBox[{
     "n_Integer", ",", " ", "J_", ",", " ", "q_", ",", " ", "theta_", ",", 
      " ", "phi0_", ",", " ", "bL_", ",", " ", "bR_", ",", " ", "omega_"}], 
     "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
    RowBox[{"HelixProtocol", "[", 
     RowBox[{
     "n", ",", " ", "J", ",", " ", "q", ",", " ", "theta", ",", " ", "phi0", ",",
       " ", "bL", ",", " ", "bR", ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"Cos", "[", "q", "]"}], ",", " ", "omega", ",", " ", "omega", ",",
       " ", "True"}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"ProtocolFields", "[", 
     RowBox[{"p_Association", ",", " ", "t_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
    RowBox[{"If", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"TrueQ", "[", 
       RowBox[{"p", "[", "\"\<EdgeFields\>\"", "]"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"MatchedEdgeFields", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"p", "[", "\"\<J\>\"", "]"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"p", "[", "\"\<q\>\"", "]"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"p", "[", "\"\<theta\>\"", "]"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"p", "[", "\"\<phi0\>\"", "]"}], " ", "+", " ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"p", "[", "\"\<FieldOmega\>\"", "]"}], " ", "t"}]}], ",", 
        " ", 
        RowBox[{"p", "[", "\"\<L\>\"", "]"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"p", "[", "\"\<bL\>\"", "]"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"p", "[", "\"\<bR\>\"", "]"}]}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", "0", ",", " ", "0"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", "0", ",", " ", "0"}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}], 
     "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"ProtocolHamiltonian", "[", 
     RowBox[{"p_Association", ",", " ", "t_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
    RowBox[{"With", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"f", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"ProtocolFields", "[", 
         RowBox[{"p", ",", " ", "t"}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"OpenXXZHamiltonian", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"p", "[", "\"\<J\>\"", "]"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"p", "[", "\"\<Delta\>\"", "]"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"p", "[", "\"\<L\>\"", "]"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"f", "[", 
         RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"f", "[", 
         RowBox[{"[", "2", "]"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"p", "[", "\"\<hz\>\"", "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], 
  "\n"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"RotatingFrameGenerator", "[", "p_Association", "]"}], " ", ":=", 
    " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"ProtocolHamiltonian", "[", 
      RowBox[{"p", ",", " ", "0"}], "]"}], " ", "-", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"p", "[", "\"\<FieldOmega\>\"", "]"}], " ", 
      RowBox[{"TotalSzOperator", "[", 
       RowBox[{"p", "[", "\"\<L\>\"", "]"}], "]"}]}]}]}], ";"}], "\n"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"ExactState", "[", 
     RowBox[{"p_Association", ",", " ", "psi0_List", ",", " ", "t_"}], "]"}], 
    " ", ":=", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"N", "[", 
      RowBox[{"ZRotationOperator", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"p", "[", "\"\<FieldOmega\>\"", "]"}], " ", "t"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"p", "[", "\"\<L\>\"", "]"}]}], "]"}], "]"}], " ", ".", " ", 
     RowBox[{"MatrixExp", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"-", "I"}], " ", "t", " ", 
        RowBox[{"Normal", "[", 
         RowBox[{"N", "[", 
          RowBox[{"RotatingFrameGenerator", "[", "p", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ",",
        " ", "psi0"}], "]"}]}]}], ";"}], "\n"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"ExactTrajectory", "[", 
     RowBox[{
     "p_Association", ",", " ", "psi0_List", ",", " ", "tMax_", ",", " ", 
      "nT_Integer"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
    RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"m", " ", "=", " ", 
         RowBox[{"N", "[", 
