Cell["\<\
Expected: residual 0 (machine precision) for A only. For B and C the residual \
is w Sqrt[Var S^z_tot] = 0.5 x Sqrt[6] sin(1.1)/2 = 0.546. For D it is 0.610 \
= Sqrt[0.546^2 + 0.273^2]: the uniform-field part plus the free-end mismatch \
0.273, which is the part that survives in the frame co-rotating at hz (in D, \
hz commutes with H, so the dynamics is a Larmor rotation on top of the \
field-free, non-stationary evolution).\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"9d1e2fe6-8ed6-a244-9ba9-ace9ab17b30c"],

