Cell["\<\
IntegratorError (of order 10^-12) certifies that the laboratory-frame NDSolve \
solution and the exact rotating-frame solution agree for every protocol. \
Protocol A keeps 1 - F at the integrator floor over two periods, every Bloch \
vector at unit length and every azimuth on the line hz t. B, C and D lose the \
helix within a fraction of a period: the overlap with any rotated copy \
(BestFidelity) collapses, and the edge spins become entangled with the bulk \
(Bloch length well below 1).\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"33ab4615-64ff-d346-8404-a45779b99bc7"],

